===== Misc =====

**USB Port**
  * Each USB 3.0 port has 2A overcurrent protection.

**RTC**
  * RTC backup current is 27uA.
  * Connector P/N: Molex 53398-0271

**Power Input**
  * 5V/3A, via USB Type-C(USB PD Specification is not supported) or Pin1&Pin2 of the 2x5-pin header

